\subsection{CFL Stability}

Relativistic Alfvén speed:
\begin{equation}
  v_A^2
  =
  \frac{b^2}{\rho h + b^2}.
\end{equation}

Directional characteristic speeds:
\begin{equation}
  v_{\text{max},i}
  =
  \max\{c_s, v_{A,i}, \text{relativistic wave speeds}\},
  \quad i = x,y,z.
\end{equation}

CFL condition:
\begin{equation}
  \Delta t
  \leq
  C_{\text{CFL}}
  \min\left(
    \frac{\Delta x}{v_{\text{max},x}},
    \frac{\Delta y}{v_{\text{max},y}},
    \frac{\Delta z}{v_{\text{max},z}}
  \right),
\end{equation}
with $0 < C_{\text{CFL}} < 1$.

TVD + PPM reconstruction ensures:
\begin{equation}
